<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ANBEECO TALKS HALTED, CAUTIONARY WITHDRAWN.</title>
<headline>ANBEECO TALKS HALTED, CAUTIONARY WITHDRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anbeeco Investment Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that negotiations first announced on July 1 had been terminated and it was withdrawing its cautionary announcement.</p>
<p>No further details were given in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
